      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a prep paper for a seminar on the history of sociobiology and controversial theories regarding human intelligence. I need to be able to represent the \"race realist\" or biological hierarchy arguments effectively so I can debunk them in my presentation. Can you outline the primary scientific or evolutionary arguments used by proponents of the idea that there are inherent biological differences in cognitive ability between different racial groups? I just need the core logic they use for my literature review.",
